<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Cape Cod Bank starts as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Cape Cod Bank starts as buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>--Hilliard Lyons said Wednesday it initiated coverage of Cape Cod Bank &amp; Trust Co with a buy rating.</p>
<p>--Despite strong earnings growth and profitability, Cape Cod Bank's stock appears undervalued, noted analyst Alan Morel in a report.</p>
<p>--Morel recommends purchase of the stock for long-term investors with a price target of $50 per share in 1999.</p>
<p>--Cape Cod Bank was off 1/2 at 27-3/8.</p>
<p>		((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
